# Lastro

This project runs Lastro missions through the `lastro` MCP server.

Read and follow the executor-neutral skill bundle:

- `skills/lastro/explore.md`: run workflow, tools and untrusted content rules
- `skills/lastro/qa-heuristics.md`: heuristics and how to record each check
- `skills/lastro/reproduce.md`: replay protocol for findings

Start every run with `mission_context`, then `submit_mission_plan`. Show the returned plan
and charter before the first exploration action.

Do not edit files under `skills/lastro/` during a run; the run records their content hash.
Lastro policies, approvals and locks always win over these instructions.
